    "sections": {
        "description": "Auto Parts and Car Accessories is a modern, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress theme designed specifically for auto parts stores, car accessories shops, vehicle service centers, and automotive eCommerce websites. The theme is WooCommerce ready, allowing you to easily sell car spare parts, bike accessories, tools, tyres, batteries, engine parts, and automotive products online. With a clean layout, conversion-focused design, and SEO-optimized structure, this theme helps improve search engine visibility while delivering a smooth user experience. Auto Parts and Car Accessories is fully compatible with the Gutenberg block editor and follows WordPress coding standards. It offers easy customization through the WordPress Customizer, letting you modify colors, fonts, headers, footers, and layouts without writing any code. Optimized performance and lightweight code ensure fast loading times across all devices. More details: https://www.templatehouse.net/themes/auto-parts-woocommerce-theme/"
    },
